ISO-10303-21;
/* Ad129: Negative-determinant CARTESIAN_TRANSFORMATION_OPERATOR_3D (det=-1, reflection) in MAPPED_ITEM: axis1=(1,0,0) axis2=(0,1,0) axis3=(0,0,-1) form a left-handed coord system; conforming readers produce a mirror image of component B; readers that force det=+1 (silently orthogonalize) produce wrong orientation; OCCT silently treats as identity, yields shape(1); Fusion 360 mirror pattern STEP export DEF-V */
